# Provenance: a diagnostic for content lowered from a .cch must name the .cch
# the user wrote (not the generated out/include/.../*.h) AND the correct line.
# The syntax error is on line 9 of tests/hdr_line_provenance.cch.
# What is pinned is that location. The wording is not: the reference reaches
# this through the host compiler and rewrites its message afterwards, while
# the clean lowerer's own parser catches it, so the two word it differently.
hdr_line_provenance.cch:9:
